## What counts as "content"

The original Chinese-language horoscope copy in `src/data/zodiac.ts`, specifically
these exported / module-level collections and their string contents:

- `themesByElement` — 每日主题词库（按火/土/风/水四象分库）
- `summaries` — 各星座摘要文案
- `actionsByElement` — 行动建议词库
- `cautionsByElement` — 注意事项词库
- `dimensionCopy` — 四维解读文案（元素 × 维度 × 档位，共 144 条）
- `personalityProfiles` — 星座性格档案文案

Everything else in this repository — including the generation engine itself
(`hashString`, `seededRandom`, `generateHoroscope`, `calculateCompatibility`,
the scoring and selection logic), all components, layouts, styles, build
scripts and configuration — is **MIT** licensed.

## What this means in practice

- ✅ Read, study, fork, and learn from the copy.
- ✅ Reuse it in non-commercial work, with attribution, under the same license.
- ❌ Do not use the copy to operate a commercial or ad-supported horoscope
  site/app.

The engine is deliberately MIT so the interesting part — deterministic,
seed-based content generation — stays freely reusable. The restriction applies
only to the hand-written copy, which took meaningful authorial effort to tune.

## Why the split

The original site is retired; its successor runs at
<https://laohuangli.info/xingzuo/>. Releasing the copy under a permissive
license would let anyone stand up a content-identical competitor to the active
site in an afternoon — so the copy is NC, while the code stays open.

Contributions are welcome: fork it, open issues and PRs. Note that new copy you
contribute falls under the same CC BY-NC-SA terms as the existing copy.
